 pharmaceutical companies such as Novartis and Alcon, as well as having licensing partnerships with EG BioMed for pancreatic and breast cancer detection and with 3D Global to develop treatment for eye disorders. The length of the existing licensing partnerships and the establishment of new licensing partnerships will have a direct impact on YD Bio’s future revenues.","context":"Notable Strategic Partnerships, Offering Validation and Growth Potential","section":"MANAGEMENT’S DISCUSSION AND ANALYSIS OF FINANCIAL CONDITION AND RESULTS OF OPERATIONS","block":21,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-095815","form":"6-K","filedAt":"2026-09-01","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0002011674","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2011674/000121390026095815/ea030356301ex99-2.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/82642e3460e4c180cc8a1c1e00ecb1da2877f06f321210dfa6ebf2ca06942b17.bin","sha256":"82642e3460e4c180cc8a1c1e00ecb1da2877f06f321210dfa6ebf2ca06942b17"}},{"id":"d39a8677867e938feb6b90206c6896116f1d12e0e507871e7a7f6ca465684ec1","quote":"Proprietary Technology Supported by Licensing Agreements and IP Portfolio","context":"YD Bio is a clinical testing drug supplier for global pharmaceutical companies such as Novartis and Alcon, as well as having licensing partnerships with EG BioMed for pancreatic and breast cancer detection and with 3D Global to develop treatment for eye disorders. The length of the existing licensing partnerships and the establishment of new licensing partnerships will have a direct impact on YD Bio’s future revenues.","section":"MANAGEMENT’S DISCUSSION AND ANALYSIS OF FINANCIAL CONDITION AND RESULTS OF OPERATIONS","block":22,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-095815","form":"6-K","filedAt":"2026-09-01","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0002011674","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2011674/000121390026095815/ea030356301ex99-2.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/82642e3460e4c180cc8a1c1e00ecb1da2877f06f321210dfa6ebf2ca06942b17.bin","sha256":"82642e3460e4c180cc8a1c1e00ecb1da2877f06f321210dfa6ebf2ca06942b17"}},{"id":"169c223a1ee181a283e32b6c126981dd7fb7da9485b55828dcf78aac3e7b0dff","quote":"Multi-decade, exclusive licensing agreements and owned, patented technology provides YD Bio with a significant competitive advantage.","context":"Proprietary Technology Supported by Licensing Agreements and IP Portfolio","section":"MANAGEMENT’S DISCUSSION AND ANALYSIS OF FINANCIAL CONDITION AND RESULTS OF OPERATIONS","block":23,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-095815","form":"6-K","filedAt":"2026-09-01","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0002011674","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2011674/000121390026095815/ea030356301ex99-2.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/82642e3460e4c180cc8a1c1e00ecb1da2877f06f321210dfa6ebf2ca06942b17.bin","sha256":"82642e3460e4c180cc8a1c1e00ecb1da2877f06f321210dfa6ebf2ca06942b17"}},{"id":"844ac5fcd1cfb5bb982467f6187c747641d00a22eb97350e98b9bc2ffb67f800","quote":"Large and Underserved Markets for Each Solution Showcase Untapped Growth Potential","context":"Multi-decade, exclusive licensing agreements and owned, patented technology provides YD Bio with a significant competitive advantage.","section":"MANAGEMENT’S DISCUSSION AND ANALYSIS OF FINANCIAL CONDITION AND RESULTS OF OPERATIONS","block":24,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-095815","form":"6-K","filedAt":"2026-09-01","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0002011674","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2011674/000121390026095815/ea030356301ex99-2.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/82642e3460e4c180cc8a1c1e00ecb1da2877f06f321210dfa6ebf2ca06942b17.bin","sha256":"82642e3